# Yoimiya Chevreuse Fischl Beidou. ~27s Rot. (TF) Yoimiya Overload with IR. Chevreuse passes particles to Beidou if possible. 10% Counter, 20% Perfect Counter. EM Yoimiya is better; Hamayumi doesn't justify not using burst.

